      "id": "the-count-of-monte-cristo-s110-p10054",
      "source_en": "\"The sitting is adjourned, gentlemen,\" said the president; \"fresh inquiries will be made, and the case will be tried next session by another magistrate.\" As for Andrea, who was calm and more interesting than ever, he left the hall, escorted by gendarmes, who involuntarily paid him some attention. \"Well, what do you think of this, my fine fellow?\" asked Debray of the sergeant-at-arms, slipping a louis into his hand. \"There will be extenuating circumstances,\" he replied.",
